# Simple cube mesh for Assignment 2
# 8 vertices, 12 triangles (6 faces * 2 triangles each)
# Winding order fixed so face normals point outward (was inward - see HW5 report).

v -1.0  1.0  1.0
v  1.0  1.0  1.0
v  1.0 -1.0  1.0
v -1.0 -1.0  1.0
v -1.0  1.0 -1.0
v  1.0  1.0 -1.0
v  1.0 -1.0 -1.0
v -1.0 -1.0 -1.0

f 1 3 2
f 1 4 3
f 5 2 6
f 5 1 2
f 6 3 7
f 6 2 3
f 7 4 8
f 7 3 4
f 8 1 5
f 8 4 1
f 5 7 8
f 5 6 7
